import ../../site/packages/dynlex-ide/studio/debug_interaction.dl
import studio_debug_fixture.dl

to get [fixture JSON] {C string:text}:
    parse text as JSON and set parsed to it
    require condition (parsed succeeded) reporting "Invalid controller fixture JSON"
    return parsed's value

set instance to an instance of Studio debug fixture
set view to a new UI view
set driver to a new UI driver
set driver's wake to (the function named "wake the Studio debugger fixture $") as a pointer
set driver's close to driver's wake
set view's driver to the address of driver
set view's instance to the address of instance
set state to a new website state
set state's route to "/ide/index.html"
set state's services to the browser UI service provider
set state's view to the address of view
set instance's state to (the address of state) as a pointer
prepare the Studio debugger fixture in (the address of state)
initialize Studio debugging in (the address of state)
load website source "IDE source" from (the string form of "set counter to 1\nprint line counter\n") in (the address of state)
toggle the Studio breakpoint in (the address of state)
debug the Studio program in (the address of state)
require condition ((state's studio debug's active) and ((state's programs + 2)'s phase = 1)) reporting "Debug did not compile its source snapshot"
set compiled to a JSON object containing [JSON number "status" is 0, JSON number "artifact" is 42, JSON number "milliseconds" is 1]
receive website compilation compiled for 2 in (the address of state)
free compiled
set editor to the UI source editor labeled "IDE source" in (state's language)
set paused to fixture JSON "{\"type\":\"program-paused\",\"reason\":\"step\",\"invocation\":1,\"pause\":1,\"frames\":[{\"name\":\"main\",\"uri\":\"file:///workspace/main.dl\",\"range\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1,\"character\":18}},\"variables\":[{\"uri\":\"file:///workspace/main.dl\",\"range\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":4},\"end\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":11}},\"name\":\"counter\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"value\":\"1\",\"reference\":0,\"children\":0},{\"name\":\"items\",\"type\":\"array\",\"value\":\"array [2]\",\"reference\":7,\"children\":2}]}]}"
receive Studio debug notification paused in (the address of state)
free paused
require condition (state's studio debug's paused) reporting "The debugger did not publish its pause"
require condition (state's language's tools' runtime values != (0 as a pointer to JSON value)) reporting "Paused values were not connected to hover"
set hover to fixture JSON "{\"contents\":\"integer = 9\",\"dynlexVariable\":{\"uri\":\"file:///workspace/main.dl\",\"range\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":4},\"end\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":11}}}}"
require condition ((the UI paused hover text of hover using (state's language's tools' runtime values)) = "counter: integer\nPaused value: 1") reporting "Hover showed an inferred value instead of the selected frame's value"
free hover
request Studio debug variables 7 starting at 0 in (the address of state)
set reply to fixture JSON "{\"reference\":7,\"variables\":[{\"name\":\"[0]\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"value\":\"4\",\"reference\":0,\"children\":0},{\"name\":\"[1]\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"value\":\"5\",\"reference\":0,\"children\":0}]}"
receive Studio debug variables reply for pause 1 in (the address of state)
free reply
require condition (state's studio debug's rows' length = 4) reporting "Variable expansion did not retain its child rows"
request Studio debug variables 7 starting at 2 in (the address of state)
send Studio debug command (the string form of "over") in (the address of state)
require condition ((state's studio debug's query = 0) and (state's studio debug's paused = false)) reporting "Resume retained an inspection request"
require condition (state's language's tools' runtime values = (0 as a pointer to JSON value)) reporting "Resume retained stale hover values"
stop website program 2 in (the address of state)
require condition (state's studio debug's active = false) reporting "Stop retained the debug session"
ignore follow Studio debug action (the string form of "action:clear-breakpoints-ide") in (the address of state)
set pending to state's requests
loop while pending != (0 as a pointer to website request):
    set next to pending's next
    deallocate pending
    set pending to next
close Studio debugging in (the address of state)
release the Studio debugger fixture in (the address of state)
close the address of instance
print line "Studio debugs its snapshot, displays live hover values, expands variables and clears paused state on resume and Stop."
